{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1433.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"33c3d07e2628c371452aa462d34649b5b6fee09dcdae527a86bc5d55a913d030","ja":"それぞれの筋トレ","zh":"各自的力量训练","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1433.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"e64567c9773c6a0dc4a2e9444e4f037823598b1b86da7bb7c91d9931b1d3bfe4","ja":"千早と真は、雑誌の取材を受けていて……","zh":"千早和真正接受杂志的采访……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1433.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"dc03f20ab46e53f61ef8092fa1ff414df1a1914b80a3f1d3fb143afe6c39223c","ja":"「それでは次の質問です。アイドルとして、\n継続して頑張っていることは何かありますか？」","zh":"“那么请听下一个问题。作为偶像，\n有什么是一直在坚持努力的事情吗？”","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1433.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"fcbe34160f0b2bda0a1408a3f7b328b548ab3156efd0c66ef9a405e7f711d3a3","ja":"それはもちろん、筋トレです！","zh":"那当然是，锻炼肌肉了！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1433.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"6a44e5727766e23e98f2b98afb626a149271b51b0fec146183e9c31a35490ca4","ja":"私も筋トレですね。","zh":"我也选肌肉训练。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1433.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"d6d8e6525d59233338ebfca5fc5df92522ccf3b1774001683d2c29e263970f8d","ja":"へぇ、千早もそうなんだ……！？","zh":"诶，千早也是这样啊……！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1433.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"40abf3862e523bf07586151cb5e4fbcf16aceb45e03d97d3174a9f4e917642da","ja":"「取材は以上になります。\nありがとうございました」","zh":"“采访就到这里。\n非常感谢”","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1433.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"a5a610da0d6c4160773dd42220d1604ed1412afcd2592ceb14a284f3639ffa20","ja":"……いやー、千早とボクの回答が\n揃った時はビックリしたよ！","zh":"……哎呀，千早和我的回答\n对上的时候真是吓了一跳呢！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1433.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"27769c5731f2db3b30a912fc7c47987315f3362a654294baa7389348a6f86186","ja":"私も。でも考えてみたら基本的なことだし、\nそんなに驚くことではないのかしら？","zh":"我也是。不过仔细想想也是理所当然的基础，\n或许并不值得这么惊讶吧？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1433.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"a3e21a029048b260ca698af42769c1f6b937d201086aba50ab5f7e046f369332","ja":"言われてみたらそうかも。ちなみに、\n千早は普段、どんなトレーニングをしてるの？","zh":"你这么一说好像确实是。顺便问一下，\n千早平时都会做些什么样的训练？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1433.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"0b2b0122e3196e821f52e38baa802577c029c2f4e807f7a22e8e390a4fd27e24","ja":"私は、発声がよくなるものや、\n持久力を増やすものが多いかしら。","zh":"我这边大多是有利于发声，\n或是能增强耐力的东西呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1433.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"768b56f9dd50aaa7ed5b1c7df1045f9ae1cb9d78f840d9c7a1c0f9c89763ab83","ja":"へえ～！\nボクとはちょっと違うんだね！","zh":"诶～！\n和我有点不一样呢！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1433.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"a12d34298d06556a5b7ce140292f7a9e7eabd3922754ff19998096c0c150da95","ja":"持久力を増やすのは一緒だけど、ボクの場合は、\n体をうまく動かすトレーニングが多いかな。","zh":"提升持久力这点是一样的，不过我的话，\n大多是练习如何更好地活动身体的训练吧。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1433.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"d46c3638305f8aa5ccfdc25c2e29ca3fb06cf6fc3d3e2adcbcba46cac6d9d2c8","ja":"なるほど。真は\nダンスを意識したトレーニングをしているのね……。","zh":"原来如此。真是在针对\n舞蹈进行专项训练呢……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1433.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"0d0fab5c3c4214af58cea20fcd36ae960222680d6766a2bef38b4b3ab7316d54","ja":"一口に「筋トレをしている」と言っても、\n内容は人それぞれなのね。","zh":"虽说都统称为“在健身”，\n但内容因人而异呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1433.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"9f1dc2937af20d5ae88e352b2435d829f891073ef04aa81daa4979860b18b4e4","ja":"でもどっちも、アイドルとしてより上を\n目指すのに必要なトレーニングだよね。","zh":"不过两边都是作为偶像要想更进一步\n所必不可少的训练呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1433.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"af5988d2f6c882456bdcff20f9e312d53de5f1724b6dcb0982c6ae665c7087c6","ja":"……そうだ！　試しに、\nお互いのトレーニングメニューを交換してみない？","zh":"……对啦！不如尝试着\n交换一下彼此的训练菜单吧？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1433.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"1e8738c33541355b0e1a035500d91b80810599b4d3efd62060060f7b0ad89af6","ja":"今まであまりやってこなかったトレーニングをしたら、\nもっと成長できるって思うんだ！","zh":"要是做一些以前没怎么做过的训练，\n我觉得就能获得更多成长！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1433.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"dadfc37c6d0b0445c95067171f73a862c6c6077170150fd58ea50383a13e34cb","ja":"なるほど……挑戦してみる価値はあるかも。\nわかったわ、やってみましょう！","zh":"原来如此……或许有挑战的价值。\n我知道了，那就试试看吧！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
